# TIER 2 - thermochemistry at regenerator reference temperature (cloud instance)
# Rerun frequencies on a converged geometry with Temp set to 1003 K (730 C)
# to obtain the Gibbs free energy correction at process temperature.

! B3LYP D3BJ def2-SVP RIJCOSX TightSCF DefGrid3 FREQ

%freq
  Temp 1003.15
end

%pal nprocs 12 end
%maxcore 4000

* xyzfile 0 1 t2_state.xyz
